<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1MTSNK-OMU SEBEZI NO KUTOLOKA EBIBELE NO SILUYANA</book>
  <para style="h">Mateselonika no matatekelo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Eliñolo lya Paulusi no matatekelo ku Mateselonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Mateselonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Mate</para>
  <para style="mt2">Elin̄olo lya paulusi no matatekelo ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATESELONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Mateselonika Kama lina kun̄oliwa kwa Mutumiwa Paulusi (1.1). Kama lifanena okutenda elingolo no weli elyo ana kun̄ola Paulusi eli linakutenda ekalulo no Bibele mi kama lina kun̄oliwa mu myaka makumi atanu ni kamweya (51) munyima no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite. Paulusi yoli mu Kolinte aba ana kun̄ola eli lin̄olo ku Keleke mu Teselonika. Ekeleke eyo ana kuwana mu mwendo waye no weli no ulapeli (Tikezo 17.1-10). Kama yamba mu buka no Tikezo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekeleke kame ina kwikalanga ni kalulo no Majuda ni Magelike no kupula. Paulusi kasi twesa okwikala mu Matesalonika enako no kuleba munyima no kuwana ekeleke, cwale sebeli otuma elin̄olo lyaye munyima okususuweza alumeli muya. Elin̄olo kame lina kukuwanekela etingambolo no kupula ni titaelo no kupula okukumanena nomo afanena okuyoyela aalapeli. Paulusi kame atokomela ku kwiiya kwa Kilesite aka no wiili. Simba nji aalumeli mu Keleke no Teselonika luli kama ana twalelanga etingana ku ngambolo eyi. Paulusi kame akutusisa okwiiya kwa Kilesite aka no wiili kanyi esusuezo no kuyoya oupilo owo uwabeliswa kwa Nyambe (5.6-8).</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwi no titaba</para>
  <para style="io">Paulusi kama atateka elin̄olo eli mu ku keeta ekeleke nuukutumela kwa Nyambe mulibaka lyoo (1).</para>
  <para style="io1">Cwale kame atoloka etikezo taye ni man̄usa ao ana kulita Timoteya (2-3).</para>
  <para style="io1">Esisitatamako Paulusi kama ba etitaelo omo afanena okuyoyela aalapeli mu lisebeli no kwiya kwa Jesu aka no wiili (4.1-5; 15).</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi kame amana mu kukeeta ekeleke kame ni kwakumbela nji omunu yonje mu Keleke abale elin̄olo (5.16-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>Paulusi, Silubanus, ni Timoteya ku keleke no Matesolonika mwa Nyambe Sitetu ni Mbumu Jesu Kilesite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Esishemo ni kozo iikale naanyi.<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi yo ku Tumela kwa Nyambe ku Oupilo ni Tumelo no Matesalonika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Kame tukutumela kwa Nyambe onene mulibaka lyenu moonje mi kame tutwalelela oku milapelela mu titapelo tetu. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Abo kame tumihupula balubala waye Nyambe wetu ni sitetu ku musebezi wenu no tumelo ni misebezi no lilato ni kongoteteta mu kusepa Mbumu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="1TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Abeetu kame tulimukile nji Nyambe kame amisinga mi namikete nji mutende aye luli, <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>kakuli eliywi no kuwaba lyetu kalya sikwiiya feela mu liywi, kono kame ni maata ni mu mebo no kukena ni mukuyupisisa onene. Mulimukile omu tuna kwikalela mukaci kenu mulibaka lyenu. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Namutu fanikete ni Mbumu, simba nji na mu kuyanda, na mutambula eliywi okutunda ku mebo no kukena mu kuwabelelwa. <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Abo cwale mutende omwaanda kwa sikupumena onje mu Mesodoniya ni mu Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Kakuli kasa feela eliywi lya Mbumu lina kuyupahala onene okutunda kwaanyi mu Mesodoniya ni mu Akaya, kono etumelo yenu mwa Nyambe naikuta kwibaka yonje, nji cwale ka tutwese okwamba esinjili. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Kakuli aanu no sibaka eso kame abiha okukumanena naaci ni kutambula eyo tunakuwana mukaci kenu, nomo munakufutukela kwa Nyambe okutunda ku milimu, nikusebeleza Nyambe no kuyoya ni niti <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>mi nikutatelela mwanaye okutunda kuwilu, woyo anakwingula kwafu Jesu wuyu otuyoyisa ku kutweba kwa Nyambe ukeyile.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Omusebezi wa Paulusi mu Matesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Mi naanyi abaange mulimukile nji okupota kwetu kwaanyi kaa kwambango, <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>natu kuyandisiwa mane ni kwanguliwa mu mikalelo ku Mafilipi, kanyi omo mulimukele nji kame tuna kwikalanga ni undume kwa Nyambe wetu okwamba eliywi lya Nyambe mu kulwisiwa onene. <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Kakuli oku kumbela kwetu kakutundu mu mafosisa simba mu kwakena, simba kame sina tendiwa mukoonga. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Kono kanyi omo tuna lumelelwa kwa Nyambe nji tu sepahale mu liywi, cwale kame twamba, kasa nji tuwabelise aanu, kono mu kuyema Nyambe woyo otatuba mu micima yetu.<verse eid="1TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Kakuli katwasiku kutusisa simba amaywi no kushemba-shemba, kanyi omo mu limukele, simba emikwa no ung'wanyama, mi Nyambe ni paki!<verse eid="1TH 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Katu kumbele ekanya kwaanu, simba ku munu yonje, nji kame tuna ku kumbela ekanya kanyi atumiwa a Kilesite <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>kono kame tuna kutenda aano mukekecima mukaci kenu, kanyi omushemi no mukati aba ababalela aanaye. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Mukwikala ni lilato kwaanyi, kame tuna kwikala aakutukisite okukutabela naanyi kasa feela eliywi lya Nyambe kono mane simba eyi no moyo wetu, kakuli kame muna kutenda aasingwa kwaaci.<verse eid="1TH 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Aasingiwa abo cwale muhupule emisebezi ni kulema tuna kuyupa! natu kubeleka ousiku ni munji nji tulese kubeeka omunjili kwaanyi mu utata aba tuna ku kutaza eliywi lya Nyambe kwaanyi.<verse eid="1TH 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Kame muli etipaki ngeeso ni Nyambe, kakuli mulimukile okukena ni kuluka mane ni mikwa yetu nakwanyazahala kwaanyi asikupumena. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Anyi kame mulimukile omo tuna kuyoyela ku munjili ni munjili mukaci kenu nomo tuna ku tusezanga mu tikelezo, kanyi omushemi kwaanaye. <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>Okuyoya omoyo no kuwaba wa Nyambe woyo ona miisanene mu mubuso ni mu kanya yaye.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Mi kame tuyema Nyambe mu nako yonje kweyi, kakuli aba muna tambula eliywi elyo muna yupu okutunda kwaaci, namulitambula kasa kanyi eliywi litunda ku munu, kono namulitambula omo liikalele, nji ni liywi lya Nyambe elyo libeleka mwaanyi aaasikupumena. <verse eid="1TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Aanyi aasingwa, namutende aafaniketi no Tikeleke ta Nyambe eto tili mu Judeya eto tili mwa Jesu Kilesite. Namu kuyandisiwa okutunda kwao muyakile noo mu naha kanyi omo ana kutendela aendisi no Majuda ku tikeleke, <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>ao ana kwibaa Ombumu Jesu Klesiste bamweya naa nuhi a Nyambe, mi nikutuyandisa, ni kukwangwa okuwabelisa Nyambe mane ni niku tenda eila kwaanu onje! <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Okutu kanisa okwamba kwao no asimacaba nji mane aka yoyisiwe. Mukutenda ngeeso kame tumana esipimo soo no sibi, kono okubambaba kwa Nyambe nakwiyi kwa onyene ku mamaneneno!<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enyolelo ya Paulusi okwaa Potela kame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Kono kakuli natuku tabiwa kwaanyi mu nako inyonyo feela, kasa mu minahano kono mulutu no nyama, Natusaele okumimona onene ni kunyolelwa okumi mona olubala ni lubala! <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Kakuli kame tuna saele okwiiya kwaanyi, mene Paulusi mu nako ni nako kono Satani nakutu kwangwisa. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Abo cwale kandi esepo yetu simba okuwabelelwa simba omushukwe no oukununeka kwetu ba lubala lwa Mbumu wetu Jesu bakwiiya kwaye nikubine? kasa aanyi kandi? <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Abo kame muli ekanya yetu mane ni kuwabelelwa kwetu.<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Kakuli natu ku kwangwa okutwalelela okumimona, sebeli tu hupula feela nji twikale mu Atenisi <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>mi natu tumu Timoteya, omwabetu ni mubika wa Nyambe muku kutaza eliywi no kuwaba lya Kilesite. Natu mutumu muku miongota ni kususuweza mu tumelo yenu, <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>nji cwale kulese kwikala omunu mukaci kenu woyo so futuka mulibaka no mayando aa. Anyi luli mulimukile nji aa mayando ni lineku no kusinga kwa Nyambe kwaaci. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Abo aba tuna kwikalanga naanyi, natuku myambela eyi inu yakasiiya kale nji kame tufanena oku yanda, kanyi feela omo inatendahalele noomo mulimukele. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Mulibaka elyo aba kanitwese okwimana, kame inatumu omunu nji nilimuke etumelo yenu. Mulibaka no kucila nji mwendi omweeteki namieteke nji omusebezi wetu nauti omo nambulwa tuso.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Timoteya Yo Susueza Eling'usa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Kono cwale bano Timoteya naiyi okutunda kwaanyi, mi natu litele olushango no kuwaba olu no tumelo yenu ni lilato mi natubihele kame nji kame mutuhupula mi mane kame munyolelwe okutu mona kanyi omo tunyolelwe oku mimona, <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>aasingiwa, mulibaka eli, natu susuweziwa muku yandisiwa kwetu mulibaka no tumelo yenu. <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>Bano kame tuyoya aba mutwalelela okwimana mukongola mwa Mbumu. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Ngasibine satukutumele kwa Nyambe mulibaka lyenu, mukuusa okuwabelelwa tukwite mulibaka lyenu, kame tuku tumela kwa yonyene mulibaka no kuwabelelwa tukwite mulibaka lyenu. <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Kame tulapela mu kusepahala ousiku ni munji nji tumimone amiyo ni miyo nji cwale tumibe eyo kamukwite mu tumelo yenu. <verse eid="1TH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Cwale Nyambe ni sitetu ni Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite atu lukisete endila yetu okwiiya kwaanyi. <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Mi cwale mulese Ombumu atende elilato lyenu ku munjili ni munjili nji likule onene kwaanu onje, kanyi omo tutendela kwaanyi. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Cwale aongote emicima yenu nji muwaniwe aano kwanyazahala ni kukena balubala wa Nyambe wetu ni Sitetu bakwiiya kwa Mbumu Jesu ni aanu aye onje no kukena.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Oupilo owo Uwabelisa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Asingiwa kumamaneneno, kame tumikumbela ni kumisusuweza mwa Mbumu Jesu, nji kanyi omo muna ku kwiyeteta okutunda kwaaci, omo mufanena okuyoyela ni kuwabelisa Nyambe, kanyi omo mutendela, mutende ngeeso mane ni kubitelela. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Kakuli kame mulimukile etitaelo tuna kumiba mwa Jesu Ombumu wetu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Nyambe kame asinga nji mutende aano kukena mi kame asinga nji mutunde kweyi no kutenda ouhule, <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>nji omunjili ni munjili kwaanyi alimuke okusiulula olutu lwaye nomo no ku yoyela ni moyo waye mu kukena ni likute <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>kasa mu titakazo no uhule kanyi asimacaba ao kaalimukile Nyambe. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Abo cwale kulese kwikala omunu so foseza mandaye mu mukwa ou, kakuli Ombumu mbabi ekoto kwao satende ngeeso kanyi omo tuna kumi lemuseta. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Kakuli Nyambe kasikutu isaanena mu kwikala aano kutenda ouhule kono aano kukena. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Abo cwale, woyo okana eyi kakana omunu, kono kame akana Nyambe, woyo oba Emebo yaye no kukena kwaanyi.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Kono okukumanena ni lilato kwa kwenu, kakwisa woyo ofanena okuming'olela kakuli anyi mwenyene na mukwiyetiwa kwa Nyambe nji mukusinge omunjili ku mujili. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Mi muniti luli kame musinga aakwenu mu Mesodoniya monje. Mi kame tumikandiketa nji mutende yongeso mu nako yonje. <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Mutende emihupulo yenu okuyoya mukondoka, okutwalela etingana kwiinu yenu fela mane ni kusebeza ni makaa enu kanyi omo tuna ku miyeteta. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Mukutenda ngeeso mbamubiwi elikute kwaao kasa aaasikupumena, mane nikuyoya mu mukwa no kwasepa omunu.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okwiiya kwa Mbumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Abange kono katusingi nji mwikale mukwaa limuka, okukumanena nawo asilanganine nji mulese okutenda aanu no kulila kanyi omo atendela aakwenu nambulwa sepo. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Okumona nji kame tupumena nji Jesu nakufa mi nainguka kame, simba ngeeso, kame tupumena nji Nyambe mbaliti Jesu nawo asilanganine awo apumena mwa yonyene. <verse eid="1TH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Mweyi kame twamba kwaanyi ni liywi lya Mbumu, nji cwale aaci ao asiyoya tuna siiwa okutwala abo saiyele Ombumu katutamba kutwaletela ao asilanganine. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Abo Mbumu yonyene mbashetumuka okutunda kuwilu ni liywi no taelo, ni liywi no ling'eloi no mukulu, mi ni mulumo no tolombita ya Nyambe mi ao anafele kwa Kilesite mbaainguka oweli, <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>cwale aaci tusiyoya mbatukuwanene mu makumbi nonyene ni kukuwana ni Mbumu mu mebo, mi mbatukaikalanga ni Mbumu enako yonje. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Abo cwale mukuomba-ombe omunjili ku munjili ni maywi aa.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Mukutukisete okwiiya kwa Mbumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Asingwa, kono kanyi ku tinako ni tinako no mwaka kakwisa etuso nji konji omunu aming'oleleyo. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Abo aanyi luli mulimukile nji eliywaa lya Mbumu mba liiyi kanyi ombuyi mu usiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Cwale aanu aba aamba nji, “Kame kuli ekozo ni pukelezo,” cwale kushandola mbakwiyi beulu yoo kanyi oku kola kwikalanga ku mukati ba kuleya mi kakutamba kwikala oku shotoka. <verse eid="1TH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Kono anyi abange kamuli muuwi, nji elyo liywaa limikomokise kanyi ombuyi. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Anyi monje kame muli aanu ao ali mu liseli ni munjii, aci katukwele ku usiku simba kuuwi. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Abo cwale tulese kulangana kanyi omo atendela aakwetu, kono tutone mane twikale aano kukulemaule. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Kakuli ao alangana kame alangana ousiku mi ao akoliwa kame akoliwa ousiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Kono kakuli aaci kame tuli aasi munji, tuikale aano ukulema, tuku mange etumelo ni lilato kanyi esisilelezo naba saali, ni kukumanga esepo no kuyoyisiwa kanyi ekuwani. <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Kakuli Nyambe ka situketa nji tu yandisiwe kuku bambaba kwaye, kono okuwana okuyoyisiwa mwa Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite, <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>woyo ona kutufela, nji kame tuinguka simba okufa kame tufanena okuyoya naye. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Cwale abo mu susuweze omunjili ku munjili mi mu kutuse omunjili ku munjili kanyi omo mutendela.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etitaelo ni titumeliso no mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Kono abaange kame tu mikumbela nji, mukuteke ao mubeleka noo, ao amyambela eyi no kutenda mwa Mbumu, <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>mane nikwatenda mu lilato no kuneneba mulibaka no musebezi woo, mwikale ni kozo mukaci kenu. <verse eid="1TH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Mi kame tumyambela aabetu, okuba emamela kwao no kububa, mususuweze ao nokwaongola emicima, mutuse ao kaatwese mi mwikale ni mucima no kutatelela kwa onyene. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Mu mone nji kwaanyi kakwisa woyo ousa ouyi ku uyi, kono mu nako yonje musaele okutenda ouwa kwaakwenu mane nikwaanu onje.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Mu wabelelwe enako yonje, <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>mulapele mukulemenena enakao yonje, <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>Mube oukutumelo mu mikwa yonje. Kakuli okusinga kwa Nyambe mwa Jesu Kilesite kwaanyi.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Mulese kutima Emebo no kukena, <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>Mulese okunyefula amang'usa no anuhi a Nyambe. <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>Kono mweteke einu yonji mi mulemenene eyi no kuwaba <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>mutunde kuuyi wonje.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Cwale Nyambe no kozo yonyene amikenise mukene, cwale Emebo yenu yonje ni moyo ni lutu tiikale etino kwanyazaha aba saiye Ombumu wetu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Woyo ona miisana mbaitende kakuli niwa kusepahala.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Aakwetu mutulapeleleko,<verse eid="1TH 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Muasikupumenase aakwetu onje nuu kutubeta no mebo.<verse eid="1TH 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Kame ni myambela ni maata onje nji eling'olo eli libaleliwe aakwetu onje.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Esishemo sa Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite siikale naanyi.<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
